<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, my dearest Lord,</l><l>What else can I desire?</l><l>All this earth’s beauties fade away;</l><l>To gain Yourself I aspire.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Lord, the time is short;</l><l>My all I give to You—</l><l>My life, my love, and all I have,</l><l>Because I love You, Lord, I do.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
